<title>THAILAND: KFC Thailand sees $100 mln revenues in 1996.</title>
<headline>KFC Thailand sees $100 mln revenues in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kentucky Fried Chicken's Thailand operation should earn about $100 million in revenues in 1996, and grow by another 40 percent next year, country manager Hester Chew told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;We have 133 outlets and we're looking at close to $100 million (revenues) this year,&quot; he said in an interview. &quot;Next year we're looking at about 40 percent growth.&quot;</p>
</text>
